ns to traffick children.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3CqGUOId57OEI5ycdb6CO8u0MI1.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"Thomas Plateau is a school bus driver in a rural town in Mexico. On his way home from work, Plateau helps Satake Hirofumi, an injured Asian on the street. Thanks to Plateau's care, Satake escaped death. Interaction with local children heals Satake both physically and emotionally. But one day, Plateau's school bus gets hijacked by a group of mafia who plans to traffick children.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3CqGUOId57OEI5ycdb6CO8u0MI1.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17657","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"154545","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"53012","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"209217","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"423154","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"66405","synopsis":"To return to Japan, Satake Hirofumi roams around Mexico. Along the way, he meets a duo of dumb robbers, Andre and Miguel, and saves them from a bind. They call Satake \"Bro\" and adore him, and Satake starts living with them in the slum to make money to go home. As he gets close to the people of the slum, Satake misses home. Seeing that, Andre and Miguel take Satake to a certain place.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4eCXCHhFkFp8LSTZ1ko5eINRRo2.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"To return to Japan, Satake Hirofumi roams around Mexico. Along the way, he meets a duo of dumb robbers, Andre and Miguel, and saves them from a bind. They call Satake \"Bro\" and adore him, and Satake starts living with them in the slum to make money to go home. As he gets close to the people of the slum, 